{"id": "404061", "name": "אורך קשת של x^(3/2)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>מצאו את אורך הגרף של הפונקציה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(x)=x^{\\frac{3}{2}}\\)</span> מעל הקטע <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([{{CT:0}},{{CT:1}}]\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>רשמו את הערך המדויק (שבר, לא קירוב עשרוני).</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(L\\) = [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> אורך הגרף הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(L=\\int_a^b\\sqrt{1+f'(x)^2}\\,dx\\)</span>. מחשבים את האינטגרנד, מוצאים פונקציה קדומה (עם החלוקה בנגזרת הפנימית) ומציבים.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — האינטגרנד</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f'(x)=\\frac{3}{2}\\sqrt{x},\\qquad 1+f'(x)^2=1+\\frac{9x}{4} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — פונקציה קדומה</b><br>הפונקציה הקדומה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left(1+\\frac{9x}{4}\\right)^{1/2}\\)</span> היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot\\frac{4}{9}\\left(1+\\frac{9x}{4}\\right)^{3/2}=\\frac{8}{27}\\left(1+\\frac{9x}{4}\\right)^{3/2}\\)</span>, ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ L=\\int_{ {{CT:0}} }^{ {{CT:1}} }\\sqrt{1+\\frac{9x}{4}}\\,dx=\\frac{8}{27}\\Big[\\left(1+\\frac{9x}{4}\\right)^{3/2}\\Big]_{ {{CT:0}} }^{ {{CT:1}} } \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — הצבה</b><br>בקצוות: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1+\\frac{9}{4}\\cdot{{CT:0}}={{CT:2}}=\\left({{CT:3}}\\right)^2\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1+\\frac{9}{4}\\cdot{{CT:1}}={{CT:4}}=\\left({{CT:5}}\\right)^2\\)</span>. לכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ L=\\frac{8}{27}\\left({{CT:6}}-{{CT:7}}\\right)={{CT:8}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "<p>Correct answer, well done.</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p>Your answer is partially correct.</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p>Incorrect answer.</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "tans1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "(B^3-A^3)/12", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<p>שכחתם לחלק בנגזרת הפנימית <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{9}{4}\\)</span>: הפונקציה הקדומה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left(1+\\frac{9x}{4}\\right)^{1/2}\\)</span> היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{8}{27}\\left(1+\\frac{9x}{4}\\right)^{3/2}\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "b^(3/2)-a^(3/2)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<p>חישבתם את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(b)-f(a)\\)</span>, ההפרש בגבהים. אורך הגרף הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\int_a^b\\sqrt{1+f'(x)^2}\\,dx\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["A", "B", "a", "b", "tans1"], "nvariants": 16}